    <string name="headunit_say_demo_airport">A friend of mine is flying into Shenzhen on CA3636 and she\'s vegetarian. Pick her up at the airport first, then take her to a good vegetarian restaurant. Plan the route.</string>
    <string name="headunit_say_demo_eight_places">I\'m showing friends from out of town around Shenzhen and we want to visit all 8 of these: Lianhuashan Park, Window of the World, Happy Valley, Shenzhen Bay Park, Ping An Finance Center, Huaqiangbei, Dongmen Old Street and Dameisha. Lianhuashan Park first, Dameisha last to see the sea. Plan a route for me.</string>
    <string name="headunit_say_demo_pickups">My wife is shopping at Shenzhen Bay MixC, my eldest is at art class at Nanshan Book City, my second is at ballet at Xiangmi Lake, my third is at Lego class in the Science Park, and my fourth is playing badminton at Shenzhen Bay Sports Center. Pick up the eldest first, then the fourth, then the third, then the second, and then my wife. Tonight we\'re celebrating the fourth\'s birthday at Sea World. Plan me a navigation route.</string>
